TASHKENTSPIRE2-TORPEDO.description:
At the end of the turn, deals damage to the enemy with the most [gold]Mark[/gold], with damage increased by the target's [gold]Mark[/gold].
Hit timing is determined by your [gold]Distance[/gold] when [gold]launched[/gold]:
[gold]Distance[/gold] [blue]4~5[/blue]: End of this turn;
[gold]Distance[/gold] [blue]2~3[/blue]: End of the next turn;
Otherwise: End of the turn after next.
